(3282, 1, 'admin', 'settings.meta.app.installable.help', 'Let people add this site to their phone or computer as an app that opens in its own window and shows a page of its own when there is no connection. Off removes the option and uninstalls the app’s offline support from browsers the next time they open a page. Until this is saved here, the PWA_ENABLED setting of the server decides.', NULL, '1970-01-02 03:04:05', '1970-01-02 03:04:05', 1),
