(3284, 1, 'admin', 'settings.meta.auth.password_sign_in.help', 'Off: people sign in and sign up only with the identity provider. Password sign-in, reset and two-step set-up stop. The server can turn it back on with whity-cli auth password-sign-in on.', NULL, '1970-01-02 03:04:05', '1970-01-02 03:04:05', 1),
