(3355, 1, 'admin', 'settings.meta.plugins.billing_email_senders.help', 'The plugins that may send Whity''s own billing emails, receipts and failed payments, to the people who pay for each workspace, in this instance''s name. Plugin names exactly as the plugins page shows them, separated by commas, for example WhityPay. Leave this empty so no plugin can.', NULL, '1970-01-02 03:04:05', '1970-01-02 03:04:05', 1),
